From: PW3 Android port
Subject: [PW3] SystemUI: no auto-dim of navigation buttons with bars that always look the same

2.25 s after the last touch of the navigation bar its buttons fade to 60% when
no wallpaper shows, that is in every application. With config_opaqueSystemBars
(patch 0015: the bars look the same over every window) that is a change of the
bar the user did not ask for: on e-paper a slow update each time, and grey
buttons. An application asking
for low profile (SYSTEM_UI_FLAG_LOW_PROFILE) still dims them.

--- a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/statusbar/phone/NavigationBarTransitions.java
+++ b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/statusbar/phone/NavigationBarTransitions.java
@@ -41,6 +41,8 @@
 
